        {
            "display_name": "Content Detail Items",
            "entries": [
                {
                    "data": {
                        "text": "<h2>Build a High Productivity System That Actually Works</h2><h3>Create a Clear Daily Plan</h3><p>Productivity begins with clarity. Start each day by identifying your top priorities and writing down the most important tasks you need to complete. Focus on a short list instead of trying to do everything at once.</p><h3>Use Time Blocking</h3><p>Assign specific blocks of time for deep work, meetings, emails, breaks, and planning. Scheduling your day in advance reduces distractions and helps you stay consistent.</p><h3>Eliminate Unnecessary Distractions</h3><p>Turn off non-essential notifications, keep your workspace clean, and create an environment that supports concentration.</p><h3>Work in Focus Sessions</h3><p>Use focused work intervals such as 25, 45, or 60 minutes followed by short breaks. This keeps energy levels stable throughout the day.</p><h3>Track Tasks in One Trusted System</h3><p>Keep all tasks, ideas, deadlines, and reminders in one place. A reliable system prevents mental overload.</p><h3>Review Progress Weekly</h3><p>Take time each week to review completed tasks, unfinished priorities, and upcoming goals.</p><h3>Protect Your Energy</h3><p>Sleep well, exercise regularly, eat balanced meals, and schedule recovery time. High productivity is also about managing energy.</p><p>The best productivity system is simple, repeatable, and built around your real life.</p>",
                        "type": "text",
                        "lookup_key": "productivity_system_fullcontent"
                    },
                    "status": "draft",
                    "locale": "en"
                },
                {
                    "data": {
                        "text": "<p></p>",
                        "type": "video",
                        "button_url": null,
                        "lookup_key": "productivity_system_video",
                        "button_text": null,
                        "banner_image": null,
                        "banner_video": "https://archive.org/download/productivity-series-files-and-folders-macmost-2575/2575ProductivityFiles.mp4",
