                {
                    "data": {
                        "text": "<h2>How to Pack a Suitcase Like a Pro</h2>",
                        "type": "text",
                        "lookup_key": "travel_packing_lg_title"
                    },
                    "status": "draft",
                    "locale": "en"
                },
                {
                    "data": {
                        "text": "<h3>Start With a Packing List</h3><p>Before placing anything in your suitcase, make a list of essentials such as clothing, toiletries, chargers, travel documents, and medications.</p><h3>Choose the Right Clothes</h3><p>Pack versatile clothing that can be mixed and matched. Choose neutral colors and lightweight fabrics that are easy to layer.</p><h3>Roll Instead of Fold</h3><p>Rolling clothes instead of folding them can save space and reduce wrinkles.</p><h3>Use Packing Cubes</h3><p>Packing cubes help organize your suitcase by category and make unpacking faster.</p><h3>Place Heavy Items at the Bottom</h3><p>Shoes and heavier objects should sit near the wheels to help balance the bag.</p><h3>Keep Essentials in Your Carry-On</h3><p>Always carry valuables, travel documents, medications, and one extra outfit in your carry-on in case checked luggage is delayed.</p><p>With smart packing habits, every trip becomes easier, lighter, and more enjoyable.</p>",
                        "type": "text",
                        "lookup_key": "travel_packing_lg_body"
                    },
                    "status": "draft",
                    "locale": "en"
                },
